{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>Do not look behind you, etc.</b> The reason is, on one side, that the countenance of a person proclaims what he has done; therefore he must not turn his face toward the city, for there are the destroying angels and they would recognize in him the sign of disgust (i.e., spiritual corruption), and he has no merit to be saved from them. Go out and learn what happened to his wife."], :book :genesis, :voice :or-hachaim, :lang :en, :chapter 19, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T19:42:21.425245113Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}